notes={1777:'Title: Demonstration of AI in Humanoid Robot, Lecture 56.',1778:'Roadmap/contents only.',1779:'Verbal speech, non-verbal expression/gaze/proximity, and physical touch/manipulation. Highlighted RealSense camera captures visual observations; it does not establish an onboard seven-class inference implementation. Trust depends on contextual and calibrated responses.',1780:'Vision, speech and language are distinct modalities. Names early/late/hybrid fusion are listed without operational mathematical definitions. Visual information is converted to natural-language context; robustness claims require reliability and timing qualifications.',1781:'Perception camera→face detection→DeepFace→seven labels; conversational microphone→OpenAI API→response→speaker. Context integration is described before response generation. Six functional middleware roles need not correspond to six process/node ovals.',1782:'Annotated Jetson Orin Nano is compute, RealSense RGB/depth capture, microphone input, speaker output, screen visualization. USB, power and interconnection are visible; diagram is not a performance benchmark.',1783:'Ubuntu 22.04 OS, ROS2 Humble middleware, OpenCV/DeepFace perception, OpenAI API voice, Python integration and bidirectional WebSockets. No executable code shown.',1784:'Acquire image, detect face, crop, DeepFace expression inference, label and ROS2 publication. Camera depth acquisition does not specify expression-network input channels.',1785:'Crop resize/normalization; convolutional feature extraction; Softmax/max score/confidence filtering. Screenshot is historical, not an independent accuracy or throughput measurement. Normalization cannot guarantee arbitrary lighting invariance.',1786:'Seven categories happy, sad, angry, neutral, fear, surprise, disgust. Pretrained inference applies learned parameters. Displayed confidence is not validated accuracy or proof of internal state. Low-confidence rejection differs from a neutral category.',1787:'Speech understanding, context and dialogue continuity; considerate tone can adapt without replacing explicit user intent. Applications are proposed uses, not controlled efficacy claims.',1788:'Persistent WebSocket voice stream, incremental input/output and event-driven context. Functional sequence does not prove mandatory complete transcript or only one supported transport. Correct interruption requires application configuration.',1789:'Session, buffer append, VAD, transcription/context, synthesis/audio continuation. VAD detects speech boundaries, not semantics. Duplex transport and semantic event state are distinct. Automatic interruption wording is conditional, not a transport guarantee.',1790:'Digital audio sampling, sequential chunks, buffering and incremental playback. Finite jitter buffer cannot guarantee no underflow during unlimited outage. Stopping generation does not clear client queued audio. Historical screenshot shows speech overlay, no calibrated timing.',1791:'Face overlay, labels/confidence, topic monitoring, logs and session recording. Interface timestamps diagnose missing/stale context. Accuracy needs reference labels and evaluation, not confidence or repeated identical labels.',1792:'Vision→emotion→text context→Realtime→emotion-aware response. Independent modules exchange structured context; labels are estimates. Stable interface meanings matter for replacement.',1793:'Static personality/objectives versus dynamic estimated-expression context; spoken intent prioritized. Redundant updates avoided; prompt text changes are not parameter updates. No explicit update algorithm is supplied.',1794:'Actual two input paths join at Context. Lower path runs right-to-left from OpenAI Realtime through Speech, Language, Speech, Robot to Human. Parallel branches can precede serial downstream work; no measured latency specified.',1795:'Full-resolution graph personally traced: /camera_node publishes depth and color; /face_detection_node receives both; /emotion_node receives color and /human_face; /human_face/annotated goes to /visualization_node. /human_emotion goes to /tara_node and /visualization_node. /tara_node publishes /chatgpt_response and /speech_text to visualization. Five ovals; rectangular topics and namespace groups are not extra nodes. QoS and launch are distinct; middleware still has interface dependencies.',1796:'Launch file initializes components; concurrent capture/perception/conversation/publication. Vertical diagram is conceptual, not proof of serialization, exact parameters or timestamp synchronization. No launch source or executable program is present.',1797:'Demonstration photograph and caption show a greeting setup, not controlled accuracy, generalizability or latency evidence.',1798:'USB bandwidth, inference-runtime/driver compatibility, async synchronization, cloud connectivity and modular debugging. Supplied resource arithmetic must not be portrayed as hardware measurements.',1799:'Healthcare, education, hospitality, companion, industrial and reception applications. Confusion/engagement are not direct seven-class labels; interpretation needs validation. Facial estimate is not diagnosis.',1800:'Summary repeats substantive pages; broad reliability/effectiveness language remains qualified.',1801:'References include humanoid design patent, NVIDIA, DeepFace, OpenAI, ROS2, RealSense and DJI. Bibliographic page only.',1802:'Thank-you closing only.'}
