reason={1779:['Speech is verbal, gaze is non-verbal, touch is physical.','Uncertainty should be acknowledged rather than replacing a spoken request.','Camera annotation identifies acquisition, not final inference or display.'],1780:['Visual estimate and spoken request are distinct information modalities.','The supplied late-fusion definition combines completed decision scores.','Estimated expression is serialized into language context.','An unreliable stale input can degrade a fused decision.'],1781:['The described context integration precedes generated response.','Audio I/O is a function, microphone/speaker are devices.'],1782:['Jetson computes; camera acquires; microphone receives; speaker emits.','The cloud dialogue dependency remains despite onboard vision.'],1783:['Ubuntu is OS; ROS2 is communication middleware.','OpenCV acquisition/preprocessing, DeepFace inference and Python integration have different roles.'],1784:['Localization precedes crop/inference/publication.','A valid box with no class publication points to downstream inference/publication, not proof of a display-only failure.','RGB-D acquisition alone does not identify classifier input channels.'],1785:['Spatial resize and numerical normalization are different transformations.','Exponentiating supplied logits gives4,2,1; happy score4/7.','Maximum0.60 fails the explicit0.70 threshold.','Detection produces localization; classification produces expression scores.','Hierarchical learned convolutional patterns are not equivalent to the terminal argmax.'],1786:['All three labels are explicitly in the seven-class vocabulary.','Inference applies learned parameters, without an unspecified per-crop training step.','The figure shows a score, not a reference-labeled accuracy measurement.','Missing/rejected evidence is not a positive neutral prediction.'],1787:['The anaphoric that requires prior response plus current request.','Explicit directions task is retained; uncertain visual cue can affect tone.'],1788:['Streaming permits chunks during a continuing session.','The conceptual diagram does not mandate a completed transcript or exclusive transport. Official documentation separately supports native speech interaction and multiple transports.'],1789:['VAD boundaries support turn handling, not exact semantics.','Simultaneous send and receive is full duplex.','Transport does not implement all response cancellation/playback semantics.','Distinct event types require distinct state transitions.'],1790:['24000×16/8=48000 bytes/s;0.020s gives960 bytes.','200−120=80ms missing playback.','Five sequential20ms chunks leave100ms old audio.','Finite buffering trades delivery tolerance for delay and cannot cover arbitrary outages.'],1791:['Trace the missing emotion publication/receipt and observation time.','Accuracy requires independently suitable reference labels, unlike confidence or stability.'],1792:['Label, confidence and observation time retain reliability/freshness context.','Stable interface and meaning decouple components without removing all contracts.'],1793:['Static identity/objectives and dynamic estimates are distinct.','Accepted changes emit neutral then sad; repeated labels and low-score sad emit nothing.','Editing context with fixed weights is prompting, not training.'],1794:['Actual lower arrows run right-to-left from Realtime through speech/language to robot and human.','Parallel join max70,110 then10+180+40=340ms.','The explicitly supplied fallback continues audio task without asserted affect.','Age0.60s exceeds0.30s; score alone cannot rescue stale context.'],1795:['Five ovals are nodes; boxes are topics/namespace groups.','Original image directly connects color to detector and emotion.','Detector sends human_face toward emotion and annotated view toward visualization.','Two arrowheads leave human_emotion toward tara and visualization.','Both named text topics connect tara to visualization.','Topic spelling cannot convert incompatible structures or semantics.','Launch initializes; QoS controls communication policy, not automatic capture synchronization.','Six functional roles need not map one-to-one to five displayed nodes.'],1796:['Concurrent processes can still observe different times/delays.','Conceptual startup diagram supplies no exact launch code or timing.'],1797:['The photo illustrates one setup without controlled evaluation.'],1798:['One image pair1536000bytes;floor((40000000−48000)/1536000)=26.','Single-worker capacity1/0.08=12.5Hz<30Hz;backlog grows17.5frames/s.','Only0.80 at9.75s meets both score and0.30s age requirements.','Different device/runtime stacks can explain initialization failure before retraining is considered.','Local perception may persist while cloud dialogue cannot produce new remote responses.'],1799:['Confusion is outside the seven direct categories and needs additional validated interpretation.','Social companionship, visitor information and operator collaboration match the listed applications.','Interaction adaptation is distinct from diagnosing a medical condition.']}
